le=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">아래에 요청하신 항목에 대한 로그 확인하였&#51004;며 결과 공유드립니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">1. DNS: privatelink CNAME </span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">통해 사설<span lang=\"EN-US\"> IP(10.249.24.108)</span>로 정상 확인됨<span lang=\"EN-US\"> (</span>첨부<span lang=\"EN-US\">: 01-dns.log)</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">2. az storage blob list --debug: </span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">첨부된<span lang=\"EN-US\"> debug.log </span>참고<span lang=\"EN-US\"> — HTTP 403 AuthorizationFailure </span>재현됨<span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">3. az account show: UMI(umi-az01-rnd-cstb-storage-control-id, Client ID 6a0703c8-...)</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">로 로그인된 상태 확인됨<span lang=\"EN-US\"> (</span>첨부<span lang=\"EN-US\">: 03-account.log)</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">4. Test-NetConnection </span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">대응<span lang=\"EN-US\">(Linux nc): 443 </span>포트 연결 성공 확인<span lang=\"EN-US\"> (</span>첨부<span lang=\"EN-US\">: 04-netconn.log)</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">5. az account get-access-token: </span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">토큰 발급 자체는 정상 성공 확인함 <span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span>원본 토큰 값은 첨부하지 않았습니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">네트워크<span lang=\"EN-US\">/DNS/</span>인증<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span>토큰 발급<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span>까지는 전부 정상이고<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>데이터 플레인 인가<span lang=\"EN-US\">(AuthorizationFailure)</span>만<span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">계속 실패하는 상태입니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">File share </span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">기능을 어떻게 사용하는지 잘 모르겠어서 본 이메일에 파일 첨부하여 보냅니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">감사합니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">!</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><div><div style=\"border:none; border-top:solid #E1E1E1 1.0pt; padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span l